+    // wip/prefill-decode-arms [EXPERIMENTAL]: the co-owner pair's KV allocation HANDSHAKE, called at a request
+    // boundary (never inside a step) by either arm.  A pair shares ONE allocation owner: the arm that computes a
+    // ubatch reserves that ubatch's cell run and publishes it, and the other arm never searches or advances the
